        <body>
            <div xml:id="d867">

                <pb facs="0981" n="837" xml:id="pg837"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.113 Radio/15: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-06-01T13:00:00-04:00">June 1, 1929—1
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>181. Your 415, May 23, 8 p.m. What is the present status of prohibition against
                    importation of radio equipment as regards both consignments now in shipment and
                    future importations?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
